            <ArticleTitle>Electronic asthma action plan database: asthma action plan development using Microsoft Access.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>191-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We created a user-friendly database for use with asthma management consistent with the national guidelines for asthma. A database was designed by using Microsoft Access for the creation of asthma action plans that can be shared between providers caring for patients with asthma. This database and the use of &quot;form entry&quot; improved documentation of asthma action plans, which are increasingly being used to assess appropriateness of care. We currently have 400 asthma action plans in the database. These action plans can be queried to document compliance with accepted best practices. Asthma action plans can be created and stored in an Access database that is both user-friendly and that can be networked to provide more consistent asthma care.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
